---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
---
<Legal title="Day+ Support" description="Get help with Day+: write to support, or find quick answers about plans, backups, cancelling and refunds." heading="Support">
  <p class="dek">Something not working, or an idea for Day+? Write to us. A real person reads every email.</p>

  <div class="lcard">
    <p class="label">Email</p>
    <p><a class="mail" href="mailto:support@dayplus.app?subject=Day%2B%20support">support@dayplus.app</a></p>
    <p>Tip: in the app, Settings › <em>Help &amp; feedback</em> fills in your app and iOS version for you.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Quick answers</h2>
  <div class="qa"><strong>I got a new phone. Where's my plan?</strong><p>Tap <em>Restore Purchase</em> on the plans screen or in Settings, using the same Apple ID.</p></div>
  <div class="qa"><strong>Where are my habits?</strong><p>They're on your phone and in your iPhone's iCloud backup. You can also export a backup file in Settings › Data &amp; privacy › <em>Export a backup file</em>, and bring it back with <em>Restore from a file</em> on another phone.</p></div>
  <div class="qa"><strong>How do I cancel?</strong><p>iPhone Settings › [your name] › Subscriptions › Day+. Cancel at least 24 hours before the period ends.</p></div>
  <div class="qa"><strong>Can I get a refund?</strong><p>Refunds are handled by Apple at <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</p></div>
</Legal>
